{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7e2f1a0-huawei-ict-backend",
    "name": "Huawei ICT Backend API",
    "description": "Koleksi Postman untuk backend FastAPI Huawei ICT.\n\n## Cara pakai\n1. Jalankan server: `py main.py` (port 8000).\n2. Panggil **Auth > Login** (admin atau user) — token otomatis tersimpan ke variabel koleksi `access_token`.\n3. Endpoint berlabel *(Bearer)* otomatis memakai token tersebut.\n\n## Role\n- **R1 Admin**: lihat history semua user, filter `?nik=`, daftar user.\n- **R2 User**: hanya riwayat miliknya sendiri (403 bila akses orang lain).\n\nAkun seed: `admin / admin123`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "nik_user",
      "value": "3201234567890001"
    },
    {
      "key": "pass_user",
      "value": "rahasia123"
    },
    {
      "key": "id_gejala",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "id_cam",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Meta",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cek server hidup."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"NIK\": \"3201234567890001\",\n  \"Name\": \"Bagas Pratama\",\n  \"Tgl_lahir\": \"2003-05-17\",\n  \"Alamat\": \"Jl. Merdeka No. 10, Bandung\",\n  \"id_Role\": \"R2\",\n  \"password\": \"rahasia123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar akun baru. id_Role: R1=Admin, R2=User. Respons 201; 409 bila NIK sudah ada."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (User)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('access_token disimpan otomatis');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"NIK\": \"{{nik_user}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{pass_user}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login user biasa. Token disimpan otomatis ke variabel `access_token` (script test)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('access_token', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('access_token ADMIN disimpan otomatis');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"NIK\": \"admin\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Login admin (seed default). Token disimpan otomatis."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (profil sendiri)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Profil user yang sedang login (Bearer)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Users (Admin only)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users?limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "1-200"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar semua user. Hanya Admin (403 bila user biasa)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Profil Saya",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Profil user yang sedang login."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail User by NIK",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/users/{{nik_user}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "{{nik_user}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Detail user. User biasa hanya boleh NIK sendiri (403 selain itu); 404 bila tidak ada."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Gejala",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Catat Gejala",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.id_gejala) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('id_gejala', json.id_gejala);",
                  "    console.log('id_gejala disimpan:', json.id_gejala);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Suhu\": 38.2,\n  \"Batuk\": \"kering\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/gejala",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "gejala"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Catat gejala atas NIK yang login. Suhu 30-45. id_gejala disimpan otomatis ke variabel."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "History Gejala (User)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/gejala/history?limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "gejala",
                "history"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50",
                  "description": "1-200, default 50"
                },
                {
                  "key": "nik",
                  "value": "",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "Khusus Admin: filter NIK"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Riwayat gejala + kamera + laporan. User: otomatis miliknya sendiri. Admin: semua user (opsional ?nik=)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "History Gejala (Admin - filter NIK)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/gejala/history?limit=50&nik={{nik_user}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "gejala",
                "history"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                },
                {
                  "key": "nik",
                  "value": "{{nik_user}}",
                  "description": "Lihat riwayat user tertentu"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin melihat riwayat satu user. User biasa yang memaksa ?nik= orang lain mendapat 403."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail Gejala",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/gejala/{{id_gejala}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "gejala",
                "{{id_gejala}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Detail satu gejala (id diambil otomatis dari 'Catat Gejala'). 403 bila bukan milik sendiri (non-admin)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Camera",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Catat Camera",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.id_cam) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('id_cam', json.id_cam);",
                  "    console.log('id_cam disimpan:', json.id_cam);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Status\": \"terdeteksi mengantuk\",\n  \"id_gejala\": \"{{id_gejala}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/camera",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "camera"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rekam hasil deteksi kamera untuk gejala. Harus milik sendiri (non-admin). id_cam disimpan otomatis."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Camera",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/camera?limit=50",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "camera"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "50"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar rekaman kamera. Admin: semua. User: hanya pada gejala miliknya."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}